WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 12]

01:44.710 --> 01:48.280
[Waterside Pavilion for Reflections, Immortal Palace]

01:58.580 --> 01:59.500
Luo Ning.

01:59.860 --> 02:01.140
You damn girl!

02:00.330 --> 02:03.940
[Luo Ning, Immortal of Xiyin Mountain]

02:01.140 --> 02:02.540
Are you teasing me again?

02:03.340 --> 02:04.260
Old Immortal Master.

02:04.260 --> 02:05.100
Take a look.

02:05.460 --> 02:09.180
This is the fragrance I specially made out of the flower buds of lily magnolia.

02:09.180 --> 02:11.660
It can reduce cold and clear your nose.

02:12.260 --> 02:12.900
Recently,

02:12.900 --> 02:15.060
you were worried about my brother.

02:15.060 --> 02:16.540
Haven't you been suffering from

02:16.540 --> 02:18.420
wind-heat in the lungs and stuffy nose?

02:18.420 --> 02:20.079
I made this specially for you.

02:22.290 --> 02:24.300
Smell it. Does it smell good?

02:32.140 --> 02:33.540
You're so filial.

02:35.420 --> 02:36.260
Immortal Master.

02:36.260 --> 02:38.740
Since I am so filial,

02:38.740 --> 02:41.140
can you take me to see my brother?

02:41.140 --> 02:43.380
I haven't seen him for years.

02:45.100 --> 02:46.260
Not only you,

02:46.260 --> 02:48.320
I haven't seen him for a long time too.

02:49.140 --> 02:49.980
After all,

02:49.980 --> 02:52.710
his promotion to immortality is more important.

02:52.780 --> 02:55.180
We can't delay him.

02:56.300 --> 02:58.100
That makes sense.

02:58.460 --> 03:00.900
But I still miss my brother.

03:01.420 --> 03:02.700
Why?

03:03.380 --> 03:06.380
You miss him for punishing you to copy the scriptures?

03:07.620 --> 03:08.340
But

03:08.930 --> 03:10.420
if he can

03:10.420 --> 03:11.780
come out soon,

03:11.780 --> 03:12.980
I'm willing to

03:13.620 --> 03:15.350
copy scriptures one more time.

03:17.500 --> 03:18.500
Maybe

03:18.500 --> 03:20.700
when he comes out of retreat,

03:20.700 --> 03:23.780
we have to call him Immortal Luo Ge.

03:28.340 --> 03:29.260
Brother,

03:29.660 --> 03:32.140
when are you going to come out?

03:39.860 --> 03:42.060
What's the point of cultivation in seclusion?

03:42.060 --> 03:45.590
It's not as interesting as these exotic flowers and rare herbs.

03:47.740 --> 03:50.420
Do you understand what the Immortal Master said?

03:50.420 --> 03:51.140
No.

03:51.620 --> 03:52.750
I don't understand.

03:52.900 --> 03:54.460
-Junior.-Hello, Seniors

03:56.380 --> 03:58.140
Luo Ning is so beautiful.

04:16.620 --> 04:17.880
What's the difference

04:18.740 --> 04:20.820
between his actions and those of animals?

04:20.820 --> 04:21.980
I never

04:22.380 --> 04:23.860
want to

04:24.060 --> 04:25.380
see you again.

04:24.470 --> 04:28.420
[Demon King of the Melody Race]

04:26.140 --> 04:26.860
Ze Shui.

04:27.620 --> 04:28.500
Ze Shui.

04:47.820 --> 04:48.980
Qiuxian.

04:48.790 --> 04:51.480
[Zhuo Qiuxian, Master of Wuxie Palace]

04:49.180 --> 04:50.940
Ning is not injured.

04:51.250 --> 04:52.620
It's just that an additional spiritual power

04:52.620 --> 04:54.140
appeared in her body.

04:54.180 --> 04:55.100
It seems

04:55.180 --> 04:56.909
to come from a powerful weapon.

04:57.380 --> 04:59.540
But it's mixed with a demon aura.

05:00.140 --> 05:01.620
She couldn't bear it for the time being.

05:01.620 --> 05:03.420
That's why she hasn't woken up.

05:04.340 --> 05:07.660
Could it be a magic weapon that has been wandering in the demon world?

05:07.660 --> 05:08.920
Is there such a weapon?

05:09.860 --> 05:10.370
Yes.

05:11.060 --> 05:12.740
Immortal Ze Shui's weapon.

05:12.890 --> 05:14.140
Bone-Corroding Harp.

05:14.140 --> 05:15.400
Bone-Corroding Harp?

05:17.780 --> 05:18.700
It seems

05:18.820 --> 05:20.060
the Bone-Corroding Harp

05:20.060 --> 05:21.260
appeared again.

05:21.980 --> 05:24.820
This Bone-Corroding Harp has a great healing power.

05:24.820 --> 05:26.660
Even if the Four Seasons Monument is damaged,

05:26.660 --> 05:27.920
we can use it to repair.

05:29.140 --> 05:29.940
How can something from the Immortal Palace

05:29.940 --> 05:31.600
fall into the hands of demons?

05:31.900 --> 05:33.980
Besides, the Four Seasons Monument is about to be repaired.

05:33.980 --> 05:34.980
We can't delay it.

05:35.580 --> 05:36.540
I'll go to the demon world

05:36.540 --> 05:38.340
to find the Bone-Corroding Harp,

05:38.340 --> 05:40.100
and bring it back intact.

05:40.940 --> 05:42.780
Thank you.

05:44.180 --> 05:44.659
Yes.

06:03.860 --> 06:04.990
Lu Li, what's wrong?

06:06.050 --> 06:06.580
Nothing.

06:07.220 --> 06:07.980
You're back.

06:09.580 --> 06:10.140
Lu Li.

06:11.620 --> 06:12.060
Lu Li.

06:12.620 --> 06:12.980
Lu Li.

06:13.020 --> 06:14.150
Lu Li, what's wrong?

06:21.420 --> 06:22.420
What is this?

06:22.780 --> 06:24.380
Why do you have these things?

06:26.660 --> 06:27.990
Soul-Devouring Spell?

06:28.090 --> 06:30.750
Your Soul-Devouring Spell is triggered again.

06:33.180 --> 06:34.940
We agreed to face things together.

06:34.940 --> 06:37.700
Why didn't you tell me you were attacked by the Soul-Devouring Spell?

06:37.700 --> 06:38.260
Liu Shao.

06:39.460 --> 06:40.990
He didn't want you to worry,

06:41.620 --> 06:42.820
so he didn't tell you.

06:43.860 --> 06:45.180
I... I'm fine.

06:45.900 --> 06:48.860
The magic I cast for you can only suppress it for a while.

06:48.860 --> 06:50.659
You must be severely injured repeatedly.

06:50.659 --> 06:51.920
It's happening again.

06:52.620 --> 06:54.550
If it spreads to the palm like this,

06:55.180 --> 06:57.980
in three days, it will corrode your heart and soul,

06:58.140 --> 07:01.200
your blood will flow backwards and you will die in pain.

07:02.340 --> 07:03.060
He Na.

07:05.460 --> 07:06.190
Don't worry.

07:06.980 --> 07:08.290
Lu Li is also my friend.

07:08.500 --> 07:09.360
I'll do my best.

07:16.620 --> 07:17.820
Common restraint techniques

07:17.820 --> 07:19.220
are no longer effective.

07:19.300 --> 07:19.940
This time,

07:20.500 --> 07:21.980
I can only take my water energy,

07:21.980 --> 07:22.980
seal it in his body

07:23.420 --> 07:24.380
and trap the spell pattern,

07:24.380 --> 07:26.710
so that it won't spread for the time being.

07:26.900 --> 07:28.260
But if it attacks again,

07:28.700 --> 07:30.490
I'm afraid his body and soul will be destroyed.

07:30.490 --> 07:31.820
There will be no cure.

07:40.860 --> 07:42.260
This spell is so vicious.

07:42.740 --> 07:44.470
We have to find a way to break it.

07:51.460 --> 07:53.460
Later, I'll ask the Immortal Palace

07:54.580 --> 07:56.310
to see if there's any other way.

08:00.100 --> 08:02.230
Where is the Bone-Corroding Harp now?

08:12.500 --> 08:13.820
Something happened.

08:14.060 --> 08:15.300
A string broke.

08:25.380 --> 08:27.740
As expected, there are traces of the weapon emerging.

08:27.740 --> 08:29.140
Judging from the breath,

08:29.740 --> 08:30.740
he's not a mortal.

08:31.300 --> 08:33.230
It must be that Demon King in White.

08:33.260 --> 08:34.169
How dare the Aquatic Demons

08:34.169 --> 08:36.059
steal weapons from the Immortal Palace?

08:36.059 --> 08:38.140
Now the Four Seasons Monument is unstable.

08:38.140 --> 08:40.000
The Immortal Palace is in danger.

08:40.380 --> 08:43.110
The Aquatic Demons got the Bone-Corroding Harp,

08:43.260 --> 08:45.060
and kept the Moon Sword.

08:46.700 --> 08:48.820
If the three worlds are unstable,

08:50.260 --> 08:51.260
who

08:51.500 --> 08:53.030
can check and balance them?

08:56.100 --> 08:57.420
Contact Wu Yang Duke.

08:57.780 --> 08:58.860
We need his help.

08:59.060 --> 08:59.620
Yes.

09:00.570 --> 09:02.500
[Wu Yang Duke's Mansion]

09:18.580 --> 09:20.460
Lu Li said that he'll send the Moon Sword back soon.

09:20.460 --> 09:21.790
Isn't that a good thing?

09:22.260 --> 09:24.580
But General Xie sent someone to deliver a message

09:24.580 --> 09:26.460
saying that he will attack the Aquatic Demons.

09:26.460 --> 09:27.860
He asked us to cooperate.

09:28.380 --> 09:29.740
If I'm not mistaken,

09:30.690 --> 09:32.540
Lu Li and the others can't come back for the time being.

09:32.540 --> 09:34.820
They should be in the hands of the King of Aquatic Demons.

09:34.820 --> 09:36.080
Tell all the disciples

09:38.020 --> 09:39.750
to surround Moon Washing Pond.

09:39.900 --> 09:41.900
But no one is allowed to do anything.

09:41.900 --> 09:43.420
Those who act without permission

09:43.420 --> 09:44.580
will be killed without mercy.

09:44.580 --> 09:45.060
Yes.

09:45.700 --> 09:46.420
Lu Li.

09:46.940 --> 09:48.670
It depends on your destiny now.

09:49.810 --> 09:52.530
Aquatic Demons hid the weapon of the Immortal Palace behind our backs.

09:52.530 --> 09:54.060
They have evil intentions.

09:54.260 --> 09:56.500
If you don't return it as soon as possible,

09:56.500 --> 09:58.700
we will send troops to the Demon Palace.

09:58.780 --> 09:59.910
You'll have nowhere

10:00.420 --> 10:02.300
to hide.

10:14.220 --> 10:15.260
The people from the Immortal Palace

10:15.260 --> 10:17.190
came for the Bone-Corroding Harp.

10:17.220 --> 10:18.980
The people of Wu Yang Duke's Mansion

10:18.980 --> 10:21.160
are worried about you and the Moon Sword.

10:21.160 --> 10:22.780
Doesn't the Bone-Corroding Harp

10:22.780 --> 10:24.440
belong to the Aquatic Demons?

10:24.740 --> 10:27.600
Isn't this Immortal Palace overstepping too much?

10:28.740 --> 10:29.780
To be exact,

10:30.420 --> 10:32.220
it belonged to Immortal Ze Shui.

10:32.740 --> 10:34.180
The death of Immortal Ze Shui

10:34.180 --> 10:36.340
was also the pain of the Immortal Palace.

10:36.340 --> 10:37.200
Her belongings

10:38.330 --> 10:40.380
were naturally regarded as the property of the Immortal Palace.

10:40.380 --> 10:41.690
I didn't expect to

10:42.180 --> 10:44.820
get the entire Aquatic Demons in trouble because of me.

10:44.820 --> 10:45.540
He Na.

10:46.620 --> 10:47.420
I'm sorry.

10:47.940 --> 10:49.070
It's not your fault.

10:49.460 --> 10:50.720
Who would have thought

10:50.820 --> 10:52.140
after ten thousand years,

10:52.140 --> 10:55.470
the Bone-Corroding Harp can still cause such a big trouble.

10:55.620 --> 10:58.150
Then return the Bone-Corroding Harp to them.

10:59.020 --> 11:00.300
Then we can go back,

11:00.980 --> 11:02.710
explain to the Immortal Palace

11:02.740 --> 11:04.340
and ask them to withdraw their troops as soon as possible.

11:04.340 --> 11:05.010
No.

11:06.380 --> 11:07.710
What about your injury?

11:11.330 --> 11:12.190
No matter what,

11:12.900 --> 11:14.740
even if there is only a slight chance,

11:14.740 --> 11:15.940
we shouldn't give up.

11:19.060 --> 11:21.060
It's useless to send back the Bone-Corroding Harp.

11:21.060 --> 11:21.940
The Immortal Palace won't accept

11:21.940 --> 11:23.860
the Bone-Corroding Harp with a broken string.

11:23.860 --> 11:26.900
They will also let the Demons pay for breaking the weapon.

11:26.900 --> 11:28.130
But you didn't

11:28.380 --> 11:29.700
break the weapon.

11:30.060 --> 11:32.120
The Immortal Palace sent Xie Lingqi.

11:32.300 --> 11:34.010
He doesn't like the Aquatic Demons.

11:34.010 --> 11:35.940
He thinks we have evil intentions.

11:36.020 --> 11:37.480
He won't let us off easily.

11:37.660 --> 11:38.660
He Na.

11:39.380 --> 11:40.710
I want to see Xie Lingqi.

11:41.820 --> 11:42.620
I think

11:43.260 --> 11:44.540
I might be able

11:44.830 --> 11:46.160
to persuade Xie Lingqi.

11:46.290 --> 11:47.380
But before that,

11:48.300 --> 11:51.360
we have to find a way to repair the Bone-Corroding Harp.

11:56.860 --> 11:58.740
Why is the string broken?

11:58.980 --> 11:59.860
General Xie.

12:00.020 --> 12:00.780
To be honest,

12:01.820 --> 12:02.740
the harp

12:03.140 --> 12:04.940
was retrieved by Liu Shao and me.

12:06.570 --> 12:08.380
But this harp has been trapped in the demon world for ten thousand years.

12:08.380 --> 12:09.440
It's very hostile.

12:09.740 --> 12:10.980
That's why a string

12:11.100 --> 12:12.230
broke in the battle.

12:13.060 --> 12:15.380
Let's find the Demon King in White to seek help.

12:15.380 --> 12:17.020
He has a way to repair the string.

12:17.020 --> 12:18.680
I just sensed the water energy

12:18.770 --> 12:21.300
of the Demon King in White on the Ice Rock Lake.

12:21.380 --> 12:22.300
That's because

12:22.420 --> 12:24.740
I borrowed some water energy from the Demon King in White

12:24.740 --> 12:27.270
to find the trace of the Bone-Corroding Harp.

12:28.420 --> 12:29.740
Could it be that the Demon King in White

12:29.740 --> 12:31.800
wants to get the Bone-Corroding Harp

12:31.940 --> 12:33.300
through you.

12:34.780 --> 12:36.180
The Bone-Corroding Harp

12:36.260 --> 12:37.320
is useless to them.

12:39.130 --> 12:40.140
What do you mean?

12:40.410 --> 12:41.140
General Xie.

12:41.860 --> 12:43.920
You'll understand after you play it.

12:49.620 --> 12:50.820
It won't make a sound.

12:53.340 --> 12:54.270
What's going on?

12:54.380 --> 12:55.580
Did you do something?

12:55.700 --> 12:56.540
General Xie.

12:56.940 --> 12:57.940
This Bone-Corroding Harp

12:57.940 --> 12:59.530
is the weapon of Supreme Gods and Immortals.

12:59.530 --> 13:00.860
We can't tamper with it.

13:01.300 --> 13:02.300
But the fact is

13:02.500 --> 13:03.580
only Liu Shao

13:03.730 --> 13:05.660
can play the Bone-Corroding Harp.

13:05.940 --> 13:07.020
Really?

13:07.820 --> 13:11.550
Looks like we need to bring Liu Shao back to the Immortal Palace too.

13:12.230 --> 13:14.060
Now we need

13:14.070 --> 13:16.420
a Bone-Corroding Harp in good condition

13:16.420 --> 13:18.630
and someone who can play it.

13:19.420 --> 13:21.080
Please give us a few more days.

13:21.660 --> 13:24.060
Don't make plans until the string is fixed.

13:28.300 --> 13:29.980
Are you

13:30.060 --> 13:30.980
pleading for

13:31.020 --> 13:32.280
those Aquatic Demons?

13:37.180 --> 13:37.910
General Xie.

13:38.860 --> 13:40.940
If anything happens to the Demon King in White,

13:40.940 --> 13:42.740
who else can repair this string?

13:47.620 --> 13:48.420
Forget it.

13:49.500 --> 13:50.980
I'll return the Bone-Corroding Harp

13:50.980 --> 13:51.740
to you.

13:53.700 --> 13:55.300
If you can't fix it,

13:57.660 --> 13:58.770
you know

13:58.940 --> 13:59.980
the consequence.

14:01.620 --> 14:02.380
Let's go.

14:09.460 --> 14:11.380
If we don't fix the Bone-Corroding Harp as soon as possible,

14:11.380 --> 14:14.040
not only will the Immortal Palace be in trouble,

14:14.530 --> 14:16.860
but Liu Shao also can't hold on any longer.

14:51.860 --> 14:52.770
I told you

14:53.300 --> 14:54.500
not to come to me

14:54.820 --> 14:56.350
if there is nothing urgent.

14:57.980 --> 15:01.420
The Bone-Corroding Harp was brought back to the demon world by Lu Li and Liu Shao.

15:01.420 --> 15:03.420
Unfortunately, one string was broken.

15:03.420 --> 15:05.980
It made the Immortal Palace join hands with the human race.

15:05.980 --> 15:08.040
They want to harm the Aquatic Demons.

15:08.060 --> 15:08.860
Do you think

15:09.540 --> 15:10.780
this is important?

15:12.980 --> 15:14.780
If the Demons are exterminated,

15:15.420 --> 15:17.620
the Immortal Palace will be left alone.

15:18.340 --> 15:20.470
Now, the one who came is just a general.

15:21.220 --> 15:23.900
Aquatic Demons have a foundation for over ten thousand years.

15:23.900 --> 15:25.300
As long as we're by the water,

15:25.300 --> 15:26.500
or in water,

15:26.620 --> 15:28.620
I have 100 ways to kill him.

15:29.660 --> 15:34.120
It's just that I don't want to attract anyone else from the Immortal Palace here.

15:35.210 --> 15:36.140
Tell me.

15:37.140 --> 15:38.820
What can I do for you?

15:40.500 --> 15:42.380
In order to repair the Bone-Corroding Harp,

15:42.380 --> 15:44.250
I need Immortal Ze Shui's hair.

15:45.260 --> 15:47.460
Who would have this in the three worlds?

15:47.660 --> 15:49.060
After thinking about it,

15:49.780 --> 15:50.900
it must be you.

15:52.060 --> 15:54.530
Lu Sheng, the half demon, is experienced and knowledgeable.

15:54.530 --> 15:56.660
Everyone in the three worlds knows it.

15:57.980 --> 15:58.860
I've seen

15:59.460 --> 16:00.520
this thing before.

16:03.060 --> 16:03.620
Where?

16:06.700 --> 16:08.030
Ten thousand years ago,

16:08.140 --> 16:09.900
on Immortal Ze Shui's head.

16:14.980 --> 16:16.660
Lu Li is quite annoying.

16:18.460 --> 16:19.620
Like teacher,

16:20.340 --> 16:21.460
like disciple.

16:25.780 --> 16:28.860
Although we can't get the hair of Immortal Ze Shui,

16:29.620 --> 16:31.750
when it comes to repairing the string,

16:32.300 --> 16:34.760
there is something else that can replace it.

16:37.580 --> 16:38.250
What is it?

16:43.820 --> 16:47.300
The spiritual vein of the 1st Branch Demon King of the Aquatic Demons

16:47.300 --> 16:48.700
is born flexible

16:48.700 --> 16:50.360
and full of spiritual energy.

16:52.530 --> 16:54.530
The Spiritual Vein of the Demon King

16:54.580 --> 16:55.860
is your

16:56.780 --> 16:58.380
or my spiritual vein.

17:00.500 --> 17:01.300
It can be used

17:02.340 --> 17:04.339
to repair the Bone-Corroding Harp.

17:09.380 --> 17:09.900
Okay.

17:10.660 --> 17:11.460
I see.

17:11.940 --> 17:12.940
You may leave now.

17:24.980 --> 17:26.859
It's lucky that the Immortal Palace

17:26.859 --> 17:28.390
thinks my disciple is good.

17:33.090 --> 17:33.890
Please enjoy.

17:36.420 --> 17:38.500
Did you mean just now that

17:39.380 --> 17:41.780
you want to wait for Liu Shao and the others to come back

17:41.780 --> 17:43.700
and let Liu Shao

17:44.140 --> 17:45.740
take the Bone-Corroding Harp

17:45.740 --> 17:47.400
to the Immortal Palace alone?

17:47.570 --> 17:49.820
If they can repair the Four Seasons Monument,

17:49.820 --> 17:50.820
they can

17:50.980 --> 17:53.100
stay in the Immortal Palace for cultivation?

17:53.100 --> 17:53.890
Yes.

17:54.540 --> 17:56.500
On the day the Four Seasons Monument was repaired,

17:56.500 --> 17:57.380
the Duke's mansion

17:57.380 --> 17:58.540
can choose disciples

17:58.540 --> 17:59.870
to attend the ceremony.

18:00.020 --> 18:00.860
Good.

18:03.500 --> 18:04.830
I have another disciple

18:04.980 --> 18:05.900
named Lu Li.

18:06.490 --> 18:07.260
This person

18:07.300 --> 18:08.500
is as talented

18:08.620 --> 18:10.140
as Liu Shao.

18:10.940 --> 18:12.660
I also value him very much.

18:13.740 --> 18:15.660
If you allow Lu Li

18:15.980 --> 18:16.980
to cultivate in the Immortal Palace

18:16.980 --> 18:19.380
with Liu Shao...

18:19.900 --> 18:21.300
That won't be necessary.

18:21.380 --> 18:22.780
The Immortal Master said

18:23.090 --> 18:25.020
to choose only Liu Shao.

18:27.690 --> 18:28.860
From now on,

18:29.340 --> 18:30.600
they won't be the same.

18:34.860 --> 18:36.060
Please have some tea.

19:06.420 --> 19:07.220
Are you crazy?

19:07.700 --> 19:10.500
Are you really going to extract your own spiritual vein?

19:10.500 --> 19:11.180
Fu,

19:12.660 --> 19:13.740
I can tell

19:15.780 --> 19:16.860
what is more important.

19:16.860 --> 19:17.930
And I can also tell.

19:18.770 --> 19:19.980
You're the Demon King.

19:19.980 --> 19:21.040
You're my brother.

19:21.540 --> 19:22.800
You are more important

19:24.500 --> 19:25.220
than me.

20:03.060 --> 20:03.700
Fu!

20:04.740 --> 20:05.740
Fu!

20:06.620 --> 20:07.380
Mr. Tai.

20:07.820 --> 20:08.770
Mr. Tai.

20:10.740 --> 20:11.500
Fu.

20:14.140 --> 20:14.900
Fu.

21:16.180 --> 21:18.340
The hair of Ze Shui ten thousand years ago

21:18.340 --> 21:19.660
was found by you.

21:21.050 --> 21:22.020
It's not easy.

21:23.060 --> 21:25.220
I hope it can really heal Liu Shao

21:25.300 --> 21:26.260
as rumored

21:27.460 --> 21:29.720
and relieve the crisis of our race today.

21:37.060 --> 21:38.590
This tune is called Brahma.

21:39.620 --> 21:41.300
It's a musical score

21:41.540 --> 21:44.600
recorded after listening to the Brahma trees blossom.

21:44.780 --> 21:45.980
The love of Brahma

21:46.620 --> 21:48.350
is the most true and the purest,

21:48.500 --> 21:49.660
and never pretends.

21:50.780 --> 21:52.220
It can be used to cure

21:52.500 --> 21:53.260
and warm

21:54.220 --> 21:56.180
the pain engraved into the bones.

22:14.100 --> 22:15.100
General Fu,

22:15.300 --> 22:17.500
you shouldn't drink in your current condition.

22:17.500 --> 22:18.830
Leave me alone, Mr. Tai.

22:20.380 --> 22:21.380
You may leave now.

22:56.820 --> 22:58.020
-Liu Shao. -Liu Shao.

22:58.340 --> 22:58.870
Liu Shao.

22:59.620 --> 23:00.180
Liu Shao.

23:15.900 --> 23:17.460
The sound of the harp is working.

23:17.460 --> 23:18.590
Her devouring wound

23:18.660 --> 23:19.720
should be fine now.

23:19.980 --> 23:22.100
It's just that her spiritual power is exhausted.

23:22.100 --> 23:22.820
Really?

23:24.300 --> 23:25.210
That's great.

23:26.620 --> 23:27.300
Great.

23:41.140 --> 23:42.740
After Liu Shao is recovered,

23:43.460 --> 23:45.790
she will return to Wu Yang Duke's Mansion.

23:46.540 --> 23:48.200
Ao Hen's been looking for her.

23:50.100 --> 23:51.620
She must be anxious now.

24:12.020 --> 24:12.820
You're awake.

24:18.260 --> 24:19.060
How are you?

24:20.890 --> 24:21.950
Do you feel better?

24:23.700 --> 24:27.300
When I think that your Soul-Devouring Spell hasn't been lifted,

24:27.300 --> 24:28.250
my heart aches.

24:45.050 --> 24:46.580
It won't happen for a while.

24:46.980 --> 24:47.710
Don't worry.

24:49.860 --> 24:51.420
Why didn't you tell me

24:51.420 --> 24:53.860
your master cast the Soul-Devouring Spell on you?

24:53.860 --> 24:55.060
If I told you,

24:56.500 --> 24:58.760
wouldn't it make you worry along with me?

24:58.900 --> 25:00.780
I don't want you to feel sorry for me.

25:00.780 --> 25:03.110
Now that I know, how could I not feel sorry?

25:06.620 --> 25:07.700
It's all my fault.

25:10.100 --> 25:11.030
Close your eyes.

25:24.580 --> 25:25.380
Do you hear me?

25:27.780 --> 25:28.660
Yes.

25:45.020 --> 25:46.820
I was born with only half a heart.

25:47.340 --> 25:48.140
Now,

25:49.420 --> 25:50.740
I found the other half.

25:53.130 --> 25:53.860
It's you.

26:18.020 --> 26:19.500
A demon general

26:19.500 --> 26:22.500
was reduced to borrowing my formation for healing.

26:29.300 --> 26:30.530
I didn't expect

26:30.700 --> 26:32.560
you would be so cruel to yourself.

26:34.620 --> 26:35.820
As long as my people

26:35.900 --> 26:37.380
can see the sun again,

26:37.780 --> 26:39.510
and not be trapped in the water,

26:39.940 --> 26:41.700
not to mention the spiritual vein,

26:41.700 --> 26:43.020
I can even give my life.

26:47.460 --> 26:49.380
I still have a lot more sights to see.

26:49.380 --> 26:50.780
There's no time to waste.

26:51.420 --> 26:52.220
So,

26:52.420 --> 26:54.620
I can only borrow your formation to heal

26:54.690 --> 26:56.220
and find more demon energy.

26:56.540 --> 26:57.580
Fun to watch?

26:59.380 --> 27:01.380
I've asked someone to inform Ao Hen.

27:01.460 --> 27:02.700
Liu Shao and Lu Li

27:02.900 --> 27:05.030
will leave the demon world in two days.

27:09.020 --> 27:10.660
The Moon Sword is against me.

27:11.020 --> 27:12.280
You have to keep it now.

27:12.580 --> 27:13.910
Go back and think of a way

27:14.180 --> 27:16.180
to see what can command it,

27:16.330 --> 27:17.860
but not be devoured by it.

27:18.660 --> 27:20.090
If I can command the Moon Sword,

27:20.090 --> 27:21.370
I'll kill Ao Hen first.

27:21.980 --> 27:22.900
In that case,

27:23.260 --> 27:24.720
we won't have any worries.

27:25.540 --> 27:26.860
Really?

27:31.340 --> 27:32.140
Goodness.

27:32.900 --> 27:34.220
You really showed up.

27:34.660 --> 27:35.710
I...

27:35.720 --> 27:37.510
Last time you beat me up,

27:37.520 --> 27:38.340
I refused to accept it as final.

27:38.340 --> 27:39.820
I've long wanted a rematch.

27:39.820 --> 27:40.540
What about

27:41.460 --> 27:42.790
we switch places today?

27:43.010 --> 27:44.740
It's not dark yet.

27:44.940 --> 27:46.660
Why are you dreaming here?

27:49.380 --> 27:50.260
Really?

27:52.740 --> 27:53.670
At the same time,

27:53.730 --> 27:55.340
I also reminded my brother.

27:56.100 --> 27:58.760
Ao Hen has been watching Liu Shao for a long time.

27:58.980 --> 28:01.260
As long as Liu Shao leaves the demon world,

28:01.260 --> 28:03.620
she's likely to be ambushed by Ao Hen.

28:04.460 --> 28:05.300
Ao Hen?

28:05.690 --> 28:06.980
This is not your lair.

28:07.300 --> 28:09.300
The Moon Washing Pond is right next to it.

28:09.300 --> 28:11.740
How many moves from the Demon King in White can you take?

28:11.740 --> 28:12.540
Besides,

28:13.690 --> 28:14.860
we're here.

28:16.780 --> 28:17.740
Could it be that

28:18.500 --> 28:20.340
you've set a trap

28:21.100 --> 28:22.660
for me?

28:24.220 --> 28:25.140
This time,

28:25.780 --> 28:27.980
we're going to catch the rat in the hole.

28:40.100 --> 28:42.140
You don't just want your brother

28:42.140 --> 28:43.730
to have a fight with Ao Hen?

28:46.420 --> 28:47.580
No way.

28:48.100 --> 28:50.100
My dear brother has offered to help.

28:50.300 --> 28:52.140
We must get some benefits.

28:54.450 --> 28:56.580
So I sent someone to inform Xie Lingqi.

28:57.340 --> 28:58.460
Ao Hen's lair

28:59.020 --> 28:59.690
is empty.

29:02.340 --> 29:03.540
She took a lot of vitality

29:03.540 --> 29:05.300
and demon energy for Ao Yin.

29:05.740 --> 29:08.740
How could the Immortal Palace miss this opportunity?

29:08.860 --> 29:11.590
Getting rid of her now will save future troubles.

29:19.580 --> 29:20.340
General Xie,

29:20.690 --> 29:21.890
we didn't find Ao Yin.

29:24.380 --> 29:26.020
So that little beast

29:26.900 --> 29:27.900
isn't here?

30:01.980 --> 30:03.310
Sure enough, here it is.

30:12.610 --> 30:13.820
Yin.

30:23.580 --> 30:24.380
You're cruel.

30:25.900 --> 30:27.700
I want to be more cruel.

30:29.620 --> 30:30.550
Will you help me?

31:06.660 --> 31:07.650
Yin.

31:08.140 --> 31:08.940
Your Majesty.

31:13.140 --> 31:13.940
Your Majesty.

31:14.170 --> 31:14.780
Tell me.

31:15.340 --> 31:16.200
What happened?

31:16.900 --> 31:17.420
Yes.

31:17.820 --> 31:19.280
It's the Immortal Palace.

31:19.580 --> 31:21.340
Even Young Master...

31:40.660 --> 31:41.260
He Na.

31:41.380 --> 31:42.180
Thank you.

31:43.140 --> 31:44.470
Thank you for your help.

31:45.890 --> 31:46.260
Hey.

31:46.820 --> 31:48.140
What do you mean?

31:48.140 --> 31:50.000
What about me? Am I not important?

31:50.930 --> 31:51.580
Anyway,

31:51.580 --> 31:52.300
thank you.

31:52.810 --> 31:53.740
You're welcome.

31:56.100 --> 31:56.610
Lu Li.

31:57.580 --> 31:59.380
When Liu Shao returns to the Duke's Mansion,

31:59.380 --> 32:00.420
take good care of her.

32:00.420 --> 32:01.700
Don't worry.

32:02.460 --> 32:03.940
You won't have an opportunity.

32:03.940 --> 32:04.900
I hope so.

32:11.700 --> 32:12.230
Liu Shao.

32:12.780 --> 32:13.510
I'm leaving.

32:19.540 --> 32:22.020
We're really lucky

32:22.220 --> 32:23.420
to meet such a friend.

32:23.690 --> 32:24.130
Right?

32:26.140 --> 32:27.260
Yes, but...

32:34.210 --> 32:35.180
Xue.

32:35.860 --> 32:36.460
Liu Shao.

32:37.570 --> 32:38.300
Liu Shao.

32:38.860 --> 32:39.940
Liu Shao is back.

32:39.940 --> 32:41.420
What about my brother?

32:41.420 --> 32:43.860
He's waiting for you to give him drumsticks.

32:43.860 --> 32:44.540
Brother.

32:44.860 --> 32:45.540
Brother.

32:46.340 --> 32:47.140
Welcome back.

32:47.620 --> 32:48.980
Looks like Fattie really loves you.

32:48.980 --> 32:50.940
He even gave you his favorite drumsticks.

32:50.940 --> 32:51.860
Look at them.

32:52.140 --> 32:52.870
Give me a hug.

32:53.220 --> 32:54.020
You...

32:54.020 --> 32:54.780
Your hand holding the drumstick...

32:54.780 --> 32:56.100
The Lord heard that you are back.

32:56.100 --> 32:57.580
He's summoning everyone.

32:59.540 --> 33:02.190
[Yu Yu Hall]

33:01.460 --> 33:02.260
Today,

33:02.900 --> 33:04.100
I gather you

33:04.450 --> 33:05.850
to announce a happy event

33:06.570 --> 33:08.780
that brought glory

33:09.060 --> 33:10.520
to Wu Yang Duke's Mansion.

33:15.300 --> 33:15.940
Liu Shao.

33:16.940 --> 33:17.580
Come up.

33:19.920 --> 33:21.250
The Lord is calling you.

33:27.620 --> 33:28.980
I hereby announce

33:29.540 --> 33:30.940
Liu Shao of Lingxi Yard is

33:31.060 --> 33:32.380
smart and upright.

33:32.810 --> 33:34.260
After selection,

33:35.330 --> 33:37.100
now, the Immortal Palace has decided

33:37.100 --> 33:38.980
to give her the opportunity

33:39.420 --> 33:41.480
to cultivate in the Immortal Palace.

33:42.060 --> 33:43.300
Liu Shao?

33:43.300 --> 33:44.580
She's so lucky.

33:46.340 --> 33:48.600
Liu Shao is going to the Immortal Palace.

33:56.780 --> 33:58.450
My Lord, what's going on?

33:58.780 --> 33:59.380
Liu Shao.

33:59.460 --> 34:01.720
If I don't want to go, can someone else go?

34:04.380 --> 34:06.260
It's such a good opportunity, why doesn't she want to go?

34:06.260 --> 34:07.180
Yes.

34:10.540 --> 34:11.860
This is decided by the Immortal Palace.

34:11.860 --> 34:12.699
Even I

34:13.699 --> 34:15.139
have no right to change.

34:20.620 --> 34:22.100
If you enter the Immortal Palace,

34:22.100 --> 34:24.929
not only can you get an opportunity to practice magic,

34:24.929 --> 34:27.530
but also transcend the limits of the human body

34:27.580 --> 34:28.860
and become immortal.

34:29.500 --> 34:32.360
This is an opportunity that all disciples dream of.

34:33.940 --> 34:35.820
You should cherish it.

34:37.540 --> 34:39.060
But Lu Li...

34:43.260 --> 34:44.340
Lu Li?

34:45.460 --> 34:47.340
I have another plan for him.

34:47.580 --> 34:48.620
Only you

34:48.860 --> 34:50.520
can go to the Immortal Palace.

34:51.139 --> 34:51.739
However,

34:52.020 --> 34:53.340
I can send Lu Li

34:53.500 --> 34:54.980
to escort you to the Immortal Palace.

34:54.980 --> 34:55.980
In this way,

34:56.300 --> 34:58.830
you two can take care of each other on the road.

34:58.860 --> 34:59.460
Lu Li.

35:00.980 --> 35:01.660
Yes.

35:02.220 --> 35:04.580
The Moon Sword will be given to you from now on.

35:04.580 --> 35:06.580
The future of Wu Yang Duke's Mansion

35:06.820 --> 35:07.860
is in your hands.

35:08.940 --> 35:09.500
Yes, My Lord.

35:09.500 --> 35:09.940
What does this mean?

35:09.940 --> 35:10.820
The Lord meant...

35:10.820 --> 35:11.700
Lu Li is the next Wu Yang Duke?

35:11.700 --> 35:12.580
Really?

35:12.580 --> 35:13.510
Lu Li is amazing.

35:14.780 --> 35:15.580
You know what?

35:16.060 --> 35:18.990
When I was young, I wanted to go to the Immortal Palace

35:19.060 --> 35:21.380
to find the immortal who accompanied me for three days.

35:21.380 --> 35:22.380
But now,

35:22.620 --> 35:24.380
I'd rather stay in the mortal world.

35:24.380 --> 35:25.940
And that Bone-Corroding Harp

35:25.940 --> 35:27.070
is useless to me now.

35:27.620 --> 35:28.980
Just ask them

35:28.980 --> 35:30.540
to send it to the Immortal Palace.

35:30.540 --> 35:31.300
What do you think?

35:31.300 --> 35:32.020
No way.

35:33.140 --> 35:35.140
They want the person who can play the Bone-Corroding Harp

35:35.140 --> 35:37.270
and repair the Four Seasons Monument.

35:39.380 --> 35:40.240
How about this?

35:41.610 --> 35:43.020
I'll send you there first.

35:43.020 --> 35:44.150
Then I'll follow you

35:44.900 --> 35:45.660
and play it by ear.

35:45.660 --> 35:46.590
See if I can stay.

35:46.940 --> 35:47.620
Stay?

35:47.860 --> 35:49.790
Have you forgotten my background?

35:49.820 --> 35:50.420
Liar.

35:53.260 --> 35:54.140
Anyway,

35:54.380 --> 35:56.040
I have to send you there first.

35:56.740 --> 35:57.980
When you play the tune,

35:57.980 --> 35:59.860
the Lord and the others will go to the auditorium.

35:59.860 --> 36:00.920
I will go with them.

36:01.540 --> 36:02.900
When that time comes,

36:02.900 --> 36:04.700
I'll stick around shamelessly.

36:05.340 --> 36:06.740
If I can't,

36:07.050 --> 36:08.820
I'll stay at the foot of the Immortal Palace.

36:08.820 --> 36:10.350
Then you can see me everyday

36:10.740 --> 36:11.940
when you get down.

36:12.660 --> 36:13.860
You're right.

36:14.100 --> 36:15.420
I'll go see you every day.

36:15.420 --> 36:16.620
If they don't let me

36:16.740 --> 36:17.820
and kick me out,

36:18.370 --> 36:20.380
that's exactly what I want.

36:21.300 --> 36:22.340
My Liu Shao

36:23.580 --> 36:24.820
is getting smarter.

36:26.700 --> 36:29.340
My Lu Li is getting smarter

36:29.340 --> 36:31.020
and cuter too.

36:41.930 --> 36:42.530
All right.

36:43.300 --> 36:44.360
It's getting late.

36:44.780 --> 36:46.040
Go back and rest early.

36:46.660 --> 36:48.460
I have something to ask the Lord.

36:49.380 --> 36:51.060
I'll go back then.

37:03.020 --> 37:03.570
Come out.

37:24.020 --> 37:24.580
Lu Li.

37:25.020 --> 37:26.340
You really only have Liu Shao

37:26.340 --> 37:27.460
in your heart?

37:28.100 --> 37:30.430
Don't you care nothing about our old love?

37:31.140 --> 37:31.980
The fire in Pearl Pavilion

37:31.980 --> 37:33.840
has burned all our love back then.

37:34.060 --> 37:35.500
I didn't kill you

37:36.260 --> 37:37.340
because of the vicious plan on the day you drew the sword.

37:37.340 --> 37:39.340
That's the most mercy I can give you.

37:40.220 --> 37:41.880
But that's because I love you.

37:42.630 --> 37:44.140
It's your business who you love.

37:44.140 --> 37:45.670
It has nothing to do with me.

37:45.940 --> 37:46.820
It's my business who I love.

37:46.820 --> 37:48.350
It's none of your business.

37:49.060 --> 37:50.460
Please stay away from me.

37:50.980 --> 37:51.980
It's disgusting.

37:52.460 --> 37:53.570
No, I can't let go.

37:53.820 --> 37:54.700
I can't.

37:54.700 --> 37:56.460
I'll teach you how to let go.

37:59.980 --> 38:00.690
Master.

38:01.020 --> 38:01.820
Kneel!

38:06.460 --> 38:07.300
Traitor!

38:09.580 --> 38:10.940
I told you

38:10.940 --> 38:12.780
not to hurt Liu Shao.

38:13.300 --> 38:15.860
Have you ever kept my words in your heart?

38:25.540 --> 38:26.380
It's useless.

38:29.290 --> 38:31.140
I have two disciples.

38:32.180 --> 38:33.020
None

38:34.100 --> 38:35.500
can be kept.

38:41.300 --> 38:41.890
Master.

38:44.060 --> 38:44.900
Li.

38:46.340 --> 38:47.420
Up to this day,

38:47.540 --> 38:49.420
haven't you seen it clearly?

38:51.770 --> 38:52.900
For her,

38:54.060 --> 38:56.990
you gave up the opportunity to return as Supreme God.

38:57.140 --> 38:57.980
But she

38:58.140 --> 38:59.900
can enter the Immortal Palace.

39:01.140 --> 39:02.660
After a hundred years,

39:03.180 --> 39:05.180
she'll still be beautiful.

39:05.980 --> 39:07.100
But you

39:08.900 --> 39:10.820
will be old and weak,

39:10.820 --> 39:12.540
just like a rotten wood.

39:14.020 --> 39:15.090
Are you satisfied?

39:18.100 --> 39:18.960
If I have tried,

39:19.540 --> 39:21.000
and the result is the same.

39:21.700 --> 39:22.500
I'm content.

39:24.820 --> 39:25.860
Content?

39:27.340 --> 39:28.180
Li,

39:28.620 --> 39:31.140
I advised you not to fall in love with her.

39:32.020 --> 39:35.080
Because I was worried that you would die because of her.

39:36.260 --> 39:37.300
But now,

39:37.700 --> 39:39.540
you have the Moon Sword.

39:41.660 --> 39:43.700
As long as you can make up your mind

39:45.130 --> 39:47.260
and cleave the Four Seasons Monument,

39:47.380 --> 39:48.500
by then,

39:50.100 --> 39:51.700
you can stay with

39:52.580 --> 39:54.260
Liu Shao.

39:55.940 --> 39:56.870
Master, you mean

39:57.700 --> 39:59.580
as long as I cleave the Four Seasons Monument,

39:59.580 --> 40:01.240
I can be with Liu Shao forever?

40:02.900 --> 40:05.560
As long as you cleave the Four Seasons Monument,

40:06.620 --> 40:09.060
you will be a complete God of Moonlight.

40:10.180 --> 40:10.940
By then,

40:11.580 --> 40:12.740
let alone Liu Shao,

40:13.290 --> 40:14.700
no one in the three worlds

40:15.900 --> 40:17.740
can separate you.

40:24.980 --> 40:26.620
I’ll take Bai Feng with me.

40:27.020 --> 40:27.740
You should

40:28.900 --> 40:30.300
think about it.

40:57.860 --> 40:59.190
Since you're ruthless,

40:59.740 --> 41:00.940
why should you be sad?

41:02.420 --> 41:04.620
I don't know what you're talking about.

41:06.020 --> 41:07.940
You instigated Lu Li to use the Moon Sword

41:07.940 --> 41:09.580
to break the Four Seasons Monument.

41:09.580 --> 41:11.380
But he's just a mortal.

41:12.220 --> 41:15.150
Once he forces his divine power to use the Moon Sword,

41:15.220 --> 41:17.460
he will be devoured and turn into ashes.

41:18.020 --> 41:19.220
Isn't this ruthless?

41:20.180 --> 41:22.820
I did everything to revive the Supreme God.

41:23.700 --> 41:24.560
It takes a price

41:25.260 --> 41:26.700
to do great things.

41:27.500 --> 41:28.420
I am ruthless,

41:31.220 --> 41:32.380
but I'm not sad.

41:38.940 --> 41:40.220
This Fritillary Bulb Paste

41:40.220 --> 41:41.580
was made by Lu Li, right?

41:48.380 --> 41:49.180
It's gone bad.

41:50.740 --> 41:52.450
Why did you put it on the table

41:52.820 --> 41:54.680
and stare at it in a daze every day?

41:56.450 --> 41:57.580
Throw it away for me.

41:59.580 --> 42:00.340
Why?

42:01.300 --> 42:03.660
Sadness doesn't hinder your ruthlessness.

42:03.660 --> 42:04.990
You still have some time

42:05.620 --> 42:07.780
to say goodbye to your disciples.

42:29.210 --> 42:30.820
Someone has to pay the price

42:31.660 --> 42:33.380
for the Immortals to revive.

42:34.460 --> 42:35.180
Li,

42:35.780 --> 42:36.900
don't blame me.
